      "type": "process",
      "size": "xl"
    },
    {
      "id": "step_14",
      "label": "报告准确率\n正确题数除以944\n比较无训练 · SFT · SSL-SFT\n使用单一基准总分",
      "type": "terminal",
      "size": "xl"
